r in Clubs and you could plan to discard one of your losers on it. Putting it all together, what should you do?"],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["ls","sc"],["hs","nh"],["nt","\nTaking the Heart finesse "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["pc","hq"],["hc","hk"],["at","is fraught with danger. If East has the @HK "],["pg",""],["lc","hk"],["pc","hk"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","ed"],["at","you have just let the dangerous opponent on lead. Why is East dangerous? If East wins a trick, he may lead a Diamond. "],["pg",""],["ls","ed"],["pc","dq"],["hc","da"],["at","If West has the @DA, "],["pg",""],["lc","da"],["hc","dk"],["at","your @DK will be trapped and you will lose three Diamond tricks."],["pg",""],["lc","dk"],["up","4"],["hc","ha"],["nt","The safe way to make your contract is to win the first trick with the @HA "],["pg",""],["lc","ha"],["pc","ha"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","nc"],["at","and plan to discard one of your losers on the extra Club in the dummy. "],["pg",""],["ls","nc"],["hs","ss"],["hs","ns"],["at","You will have to play the trump suit first "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["ls","ss"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["pc","sk"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hs","ws"],["hs","es"],["at","to make sure the opponents cannot trump "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["ls","es"],["hs","sc"],["hs","nc"],["at","any of your Club winners. Next play four rounds of Clubs "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["ls","nc"],["pc","ck"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","ca"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["pc","cq"],["pc","h"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["pc","cj"],["pc","h"],["hs","sh"],["at","discarding a Heart "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["hs","sd"],["at","or a Diamond "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["pc","d"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["at","on the last round. Watching your opponents, especially the dangerous one, pays dividends on hands of this nature."],["",""]]}}